{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1708041600, "end_date": 1708732799, "month_true_total": 157, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:06:57 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "159101437", "author": {"steamid": "76561198344556990", "personaname": "攻城狮·水之呼吸 十一之型 凪", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198344556990/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 1517, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1366, "last_played": 1709157682, "avatar": "6b8bc351de7b4b21dbf4e6f2cf544be9baf06da5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "打折买的。\n最近一口气打完了6章，感觉还可以，让我找到当年玩求生之路的感觉，但是呢，跟求生之路比，游戏的硬件有进步，但是总体感觉差一些。\n稍微有点复杂，比如一开始不知道咋进游戏，弄了个在线的，等了半天好像进不去，只好在游戏开始选择离线进去了。然后进去后在一个大院子里，摸索了半天，才知道是跟那个军人说话才可以进入游戏。\n然后什么卡牌系统，弄了好久才搞懂，就是buff么，还有什么腐败卡，其实就是这一关里面你会碰到的不好的东西的提前预告。关键是新手又不懂，也没细看，不知道咋弄了个什么摩托车头盔的卡牌，禁用机瞄，感觉好傻逼的设定。\n游戏中呢，还有一些放地上的傻逼陷阱，队友不触发，敌人不出发，就我会触发，太傻逼了。\n然后就是地图太少了，才6大章，然后枪械也太少了，想有中国的枪也没有，你弄个95式班用机枪我还能爽爽。还有就是人物模型有点少，没有亚洲人，弄个中国人武术家也行啊对不对？或者少林寺武僧也阔以你说是不是？\n最后就是生命力不如求生之路，因为没有工坊，也没有人做地图，玩完感觉就可以删了。\n其实我还是挺喜欢这种纯发泄类的游戏的，年轻那会，工作压力贼大，下班晚上回去就拿着斧头在求生之路里面砍丧尸，拿着AK47突突突，哎。\n就这样吧，虽然说是求生之路的精神续作，的确味道挺像，但总感觉少一点什么。希望还能有类似的游戏！\n加油吧，制作组！希望还能给我们带来好游戏！", "timestamp_created": 1708732640, "timestamp_updated": 1708732640, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159058192", "author": {"steamid": "76561199019017028", "personaname": "sandwich", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199019017028/", "num_games_owned": 122, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 762, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 762, "last_played": 1708548052, "avatar": "d5db7923b5ec171a586f5027dd44554ffc499326"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "第一章以为这个游戏是块美味的蛋糕，第二章觉得这个游戏是一片普通的面包，第三章觉得这个游戏是一半发霉的饼干，第四章开头以为终于要给你上山珍海味了，没想到打造了个殿堂的就餐位，然后拿着托盘和罩子端上来，猛地打开罩子，我去！好大的依托答辩！！！", "timestamp_created": 1708696697, "timestamp_updated": 1708696931, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52896726131439209", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 5, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "159053621", "author": {"steamid": "76561198377319434", "personaname": "SNOW", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/snowwinter2016/", "num_games_owned": 110, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 8390, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3208, "last_played": 1740227171, "avatar": "93d7e4387ad991c85991ecce65814ee5b1fdae3a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "玩了一阵子，感觉不如...求生之路。298不推荐，49超值！", "timestamp_created": 1708692592, "timestamp_updated": 1708692592, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159042748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198278363588", "personaname": "老白", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198278363588/", "num_games_owned": 23, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 739, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 739, "last_played": 1708681043, "avatar": "6f6d7a411db03e06f8968401849f562ef42b92b8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "石一托", "timestamp_created": 1708681074, "timestamp_updated": 17